# Personal context (local only, never shared)
.ghost-personal.md

# Auto-generated ghost skills — every new <skill>/ subdir stays local, in case
# selectors, URLs, or notes captured during a real task contain sensitive data.
# Already-tracked skills (e.g. facebook-search-friend) are unaffected — gitignore
# does not untrack files that are already in the repo. Index file is intentionally
# kept tracked so the project ships with a usable agent skeleton.
.claude/skills/*/

# Playwright
test-results/
